<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00606">
	<title>Smart Cruise Control conditions not satisfied</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e03795">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e03796">
								<image href="images/OCL4M055106N.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<ol outputclass="callout" id="e03797">
								<li>
									<p><uicontrol>Smart Cruise Ctrl. conditions not met</uicontrol></p>
								</li>
							</ol>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>If you operate the Driving Assist button, (<image align="left" href="images/WKIA_334.jpg" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch, (<image align="left" href="images/WKIA_335.jpg" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch, or (<image href="images/WKIA_079.jpg" scale="15" align="left" placement="inline"/>) switch when the Smart Cruise Control operating conditions are not satisfied, a warning message appears on the instrument cluster, and an audible warning sounds.</p>
	</conbody>
